<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Common Curriculum &mdash; Courses built in public</title>
<meta name="description" content="Courses built in public by the Computing Talent Initiative with CSUMB and De Anza College faculty, testing the Human Value Framework with students from first year to mid career.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jost:wght@400;500;600&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,600;8..60,700&display=swap">
<style>
  :root{
    --navy:#153857; --blue:#2A6FAD; --green:#2D875E;
    --paper:#FFFFFF; --tint:#F1F5F9; --rule:#C9D8E4;
    --ink:#153857; --ink-soft:rgba(21,56,87,.76);
    --serif:"Source Serif 4", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    --sans:"Jost", "Futura", "Century Gothic", -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;line-height:1.5;}
  a{color:var(--blue);}
  .wrap{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
  header{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:56px 0 48px;}
  header .kicker{font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.72);margin:0 0 14px;}
  header h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:700;font-size:44px;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 16px;letter-spacing:-.01em;}
  header p{font-size:20px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.86);max-width:760px;margin:0;}
  main{padding:44px 0 56px;}
  h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:26px;margin:0 0 6px;}
  .lead{color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0 0 26px;max-width:760px;}
  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:20px;margin:0 0 44px;}
  .card{display:block;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-top:5px solid var(--blue);background:var(--paper);padding:22px 22px 20px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);transition:background .15s;}
  .card:hover,.card:focus-visible{background:var(--tint);outline:none;}
  .card.deanza{border-top-color:var(--green);}
  .card .who{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0 0 10px;}
  .card .code{font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:var(--blue);margin:0 0 4px;}
  .card.deanza .code{color:var(--green);}
  .card h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 10px;}
  .card p{margin:0;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:16px;}
  .card .open{display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--navy);}
  .more{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:20px;}
  .more a{display:block;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid var(--rule);background:var(--tint);text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);}
  .more a:hover{background:#E6EDF4;}
  .more b{display:block;font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:4px;}
  .more span{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:15px;}
  .tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--rule);margin:0 0 28px;}
  .tabs[hidden]{display:none;}
  .tabs button{font:inherit;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink-soft);background:none;border:0;border-bottom:3px solid transparent;margin-bottom:-2px;padding:10px 18px;cursor:pointer;}
  .tabs button[aria-selected="true"]{color:var(--navy);border-bottom-color:var(--blue);}
  .tabs button:hover{color:var(--navy);}
  .tabs button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:2px;}
  .grid.fill{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr));}
  .card.past{border-top-color:#0d9488;}
  .card.past .code{color:#0d9488;}
  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding:24px 0 40px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14px;}
  footer a{color:var(--ink-soft);}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Computing Talent Initiative &middot; Common Curriculum</p>
    <h1>Courses built in public</h1>
    <p>Learning experiences that test the Human Value Framework with real students, from first year to mid career. The course pages below are the pages students use, open while the courses run rather than after.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Term" hidden>
      <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-fall-2026" aria-controls="fall-2026" aria-selected="true">Fall 2026</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-spring-2026" aria-controls="spring-2026" aria-selected="false">Spring 2026</button>
    </div>

    <section id="fall-2026" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-fall-2026">
    <h2>Running now</h2>
    <p class="lead">Four courses, four audiences. Each one is an experiment in how to scaffold the practice of thinking with AI for a different group of learners.</p>

    <div class="grid">
      <a class="card deanza" href="deanza/course1/home.html">
        <p class="who">De Anza College &middot; working professionals and career changers</p>
        <p class="code">CIS 501</p>
        <h3>Reframing Problems with AI</h3>
        <p>A ten-week online course. Take a real problem from your work or personal life and investigate what would make a meaningful difference before committing to a solution.</p>
        <span class="open">Open the course &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="cst286/home.html">
        <p class="who">CSUMB &middot; first year</p>
        <p class="code">CST286</p>
        <h3>Get Good at Something You Care About</h3>
        <p>Physics of computing, with AI. Assigned activities support a learning goal the student chose.</p>
        <span class="open">Open the course &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="cst349/home.html">
        <p class="who">CSUMB &middot; juniors</p>
        <p class="code">CST349</p>
        <h3>Learn to Direct Your Own Professional Growth</h3>
        <p>Professional seminar. Students set a growth goal and work it with an AI coach that leaves the choices to them.</p>
        <span class="open">Open the course &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="cst499/home.html">
        <p class="who">CSUMB &middot; seniors</p>
        <p class="code">CST499</p>
        <h3>Build Your Professional Portfolio</h3>
        <p>Capstone. Students choose a project, test what AI can build of it, and show what they contribute themselves.</p>
        <span class="open">Open the course &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    </section>

    <section id="spring-2026" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-spring-2026">
    <h2>Spring 2026</h2>
    <p class="lead">A course that ran in Spring 2026. Its pages stay open as students used them.</p>

    <div class="grid fill">
      <a class="card past" href="cst395/home.html">
        <p class="who">CSUMB &middot; Spring 2026</p>
        <p class="code">CST395</p>
        <h3>AI-Native Solution Engineering</h3>
        <p>Four sprints. Each sprint, students solve a problem for someone further from their own experience: themselves, a close acquaintance, an external organization, then a problem of their choice.</p>
        <span class="open">Open the course &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    </section>

    <h2>Go further</h2>
    <p class="lead">The framework behind the courses, an early look at the evidence, and the repository where all of this lives.</p>
    <div class="more">
      <a href="https://computingtalentinitiative.org/framework/"><b>The Human Value Framework</b><span>Symbiotic thinking, the three capabilities and the two outcomes, as CTI publishes them.</span></a>
      <a href="cti2.0/leadership-council-fall-2026.html"><b>Early data, Fall 2026</b><span>The six qualities in student work, from the Leadership Council update.</span></a>
      <a href="https://github.com/profsathya/Common-Curriculum"><b>The repository</b><span>Course pages, assignment designs and analysis, in the open on GitHub.</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">Computing Talent Initiative &middot; California State University, Monterey Bay &middot; <a href="https://computingtalentinitiative.org">computingtalentinitiative.org</a></div>
</footer>
<script>
(function(){
  var list=document.querySelector('.tabs'); if(!list) return;
  var tabs=[].slice.call(list.querySelectorAll('[role="tab"]'));
  function show(tab,focus){
    tabs.forEach(function(t){
      var on=t===tab;
      t.setAttribute('aria-selected',on?'true':'false');
      document.getElementById(t.getAttribute('aria-controls')).hidden=!on;
    });
    if(focus) tab.focus();
  }
  tabs.forEach(function(t,i){
    t.addEventListener('click',function(){show(t);history.replaceState(null,'','#'+t.getAttribute('aria-controls'));});
    t.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){
      var n=null;
      if(e.key==='ArrowRight') n=tabs[(i+1)%tabs.length];
      else if(e.key==='ArrowLeft') n=tabs[(i-1+tabs.length)%tabs.length];
      else if(e.key==='Home') n=tabs[0];
      else if(e.key==='End') n=tabs[tabs.length-1];
      if(n){e.preventDefault();show(n,true);}
    });
  });
  list.hidden=false;
  var start=tabs.filter(function(t){return '#'+t.getAttribute('aria-controls')===location.hash;})[0]||tabs[0];
  show(start);
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
